    <string name="privacy_notices_body">VoiceBridge does not save transcripts or translations.\n\nOnline Android speech recognition may send audio to the selected system provider.\n\nML Kit performs translation on-device after model download, but Google SDK diagnostics, usage metadata, and model delivery may use a network connection.\n\nScreen translation reads visible text only after an explicit RU tap and does not store it.\n\nDownloaded models have separate licenses.</string>
